[{"kind":"html","html":"<p>Card subtitle is a child component of card that should be placed inside of a <a class=\"\" href=\"/components/card-header\">card header</a>.</p><p>Refer to the <a class=\"\" href=\"/components/card\">Card</a> documentation for more information.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"properties","text":"Properties"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-color","text":"color"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>The color to use from your application's color palette. Default options are: <code>\"primary\"</code>, <code>\"secondary\"</code>, <code>\"tertiary\"</code>, <code>\"success\"</code>, <code>\"warning\"</code>, <code>\"danger\"</code>, <code>\"light\"</code>, <code>\"medium\"</code>, and <code>\"dark\"</code>. For more information on colors, see <a class=\"\" href=\"https://ionicframework.com/docs/theming/basics\">theming</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>color</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>\"danger\" ｜ \"dark\" ｜ \"light\" ｜ \"medium\" ｜ \"primary\" ｜ \"secondary\" ｜ \"success\" ｜ \"tertiary\" ｜ \"warning\" ｜ string ｜ undefined</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>undefined</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-mode","text":"mode"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>The mode determines which platform styles to use.<br><br>This is a <a class=\"\" href=\"https://ionicframework.com/docs/core-concepts/fundamentals#virtual-properties\">virtual property</a> that is set once during initialization and will not update if you change its value after the initial render.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>mode</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>\"ios\" ｜ \"md\"</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>undefined</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"events","text":"Events"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No events available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"methods","text":"Methods"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No public methods available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"css-shadow-parts","text":"CSS Shadow Parts"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No CSS shadow parts available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"css-custom-properties","text":"CSS Custom Properties"},{"kind":"tabs","panels":[{"label":"iOS","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>--color</code></td><td>Color of the card subtitle</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"label":"MD","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>--color</code></td><td>Color of the card subtitle</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"}]},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"slots","text":"Slots"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No slots available for this component.</p>"}]